  "title": "Dinah&#39;s Baked Scallops",
  "description": "This is my favorite way to prepare scallops. They&#39;re so flavorful they don&#39;t really need much more than a little butter and lemon. I like to serve them with a nice rice pilaf and vegetable.",
  "authors": [
